{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Ho</b> — an expression of proclamation: HaShem's command through the prophet to those who remain in Babylon, to come to Jerusalem, to help build the Temple and to perform the commandments that depend on the Land." "<b>From the land of the north</b> — it is Babylon and Elam and the kingdom of Persia and Media. And the meaning: 'for from the four winds' — just as one wind does not join with another, so you have been until now."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:50.231483482Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}